Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:01.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}最近广州冒出了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}挺特别的餐饮模式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}街上有家烧烤店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}才开一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:08.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}附近{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}5公里{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}的居民
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:09.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}基本都成了他的{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}回头客{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:11.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}80%{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}的顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}还主动加了店里的私域
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:15.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}生意好的不行我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:16.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}也跑去试了几次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:19.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}才明白这模式有多厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}普通烧烤店搞充值活动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:23.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}充100送{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}10块{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}充200送{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}30{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:25.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}早就过时了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:27.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}这家店推出了会员制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}花{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}49块{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}就能办个尊贵会员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}办完马上送一份招牌烧烤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}等于白送会员资格
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.38,0:00:37.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}所以大多数人都办了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:39.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}但重头戏是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}后面的共享店长活动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.98,0:00:42.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}办会员的顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}自动升级成小店长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}立刻拿到{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}6张{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}无门槛优惠\N券
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.43,0:00:48.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}小店长把券发到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:49.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}朋友圈或者群里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.94,0:00:52.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}别人一点券就成了他的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:54.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}以后这些粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:55.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}到店消费
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:57.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}每笔小店长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}都能拿{\c&H0066D1FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}10%{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}的现金奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:00.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}而且秒到账
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:01.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}所有消费都是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:03.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}通过门店小程序完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:06.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}老板不用费心想推广方案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.76,0:01:09.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}会员们就像{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}免费{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}宣传员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:11.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}在社交圈里自然传播
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:12.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}这种口碑效果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:14.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}比花大钱打广告强多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.43,0:01:17.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}活动一推好几百人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:18.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}抢着办会员当小店长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:20.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}既吃美食又赚外快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:23.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}这些人又帮店里{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}裂变{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:24.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}出几千个新顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:26.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}不过这个活动要落地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:28.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}靠人工根本不行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:30.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}老板直接换掉了旧系统
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:32.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}上了一套智慧门店系统
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:33.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}自动执行{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}不用人管
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}除了餐饮水果生鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:39.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}美容便利店都能照搬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:42.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}如果你的店也想用这套系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:44.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}统搞活动评论区打个小店\N长就行
